vLLM file overlays for the CYBER-FROST-3.8 two-Spark recipe
==========================================================

These directories are bind-mounted read-only over the vLLM package of the image
myllmbox/qwen38-flash-next-cluster-vllm@sha256:861ac752164e0d723c5eff3f876586c6678c26ad4a516112c48745f6a101ff4d
(image ID sha256:4d03fc80b2c28088808115eec524cb36732c8181b13ba15085095fa927b91815; vLLM 0.30.0 plus myllmbox's
changes) by launcher/vllm-rank.sh, after `sha256sum -c` of each directory's SHA256SUMS. Each listed path is relative
to the vllm package (/usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/vllm/). They are identical to the overlays in
production on our pair on 2026-10-03, apart from one comment line in vllm-roce/.../cyber_roce_ar.py (a reference to
a private repository replaced by the public one); do not edit them without regenerating SHA256SUMS, and rebuild
them from the new
image's copies if you change the image.

