  vllm-upstream/   v1/attention/backends/mamba_attn.py, v1/attention/backends/short_conv_attn.py,
                   model_executor/layers/mamba/gdn/qwen_gdn_linear_attn.py, models/qwen4_exp/common/qsa_cache.py,
