                   were ported from (reference only, not mounted).

  vllm-gb10/       models/qwen4_exp/nvidia/low_latency_gemm.py: SM12x (GB10) TP2 plans for the Qwen4Exp CuTe-DSL
                   skinny decode GEMM, from kernel-tuning/skinny_tune.py.
                   model_executor/warmup/flashinfer_autotune_cache.py: a fixed tactic-cache directory name
                   (MBX_AUTOTUNE_HASH), so the pinned tactic file in launcher/ is read on every boot.

  vllm-draft/      models/qwen4_exp/nvidia/mtp.py: the draft-only quantized output head (MBX_DRAFT_HEAD, quant prefix
                   dh4) and its reduced vocabulary (MBX_DRAFT_VOCAB).

  vllm-roce/       distributed/device_communicators/cuda_communicator.py (modified copy: hooks that route all-reduces
                   up to CYBER_ROCE_AR_MAX bytes to cyber_roce_ar)
                   distributed/device_communicators/cyber_roce_ar.py (NEW FILE, Apache-2.0): a 2-rank one-shot
                   all-reduce over both PCIe halves of the cabled CX-7 port, adapted from b12x's RoCEnante.
                   Needs b12x (https://github.com/local-inference-lab/b12x, Apache-2.0, commit
                   e4084d2eef4932e0fa06db3f7a94deb83ad132d7), which is NOT included here; the launcher mounts a
                   checkout read-only (B12X=<short sha>).

image-diffs/ (each set) = our unified diff of every file against the image's copy; upstream-prs/ = upstream sources.
Both are documentation; only the paths listed in each SHA256SUMS are mounted.
